{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>英偉達高層與客户企業管理人員之間的私人關係再次引發關注。</strong>據報道，英偉達前全球業務執行副總裁傑伊·普裏與超微電腦前首席增長官陳仙莉（音譯）交往多年，兩人已於2026年3月7日在美國加利福尼亞州結婚。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588064.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.701028+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:38:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_hash":"2f2c4bfbe8197ec03304bcc933ad6b863db0489501a5b2e4f80c8548a316814f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}